# ---- Claude design / build / audit packages (root) ----
CentralHome_ClaudeCode_BuildPackage/
CentralHome_ClaudeCode_BuildPackage.zip
HomeHub_ClaudeDesign/
HomeHub_ClaudeDesign.zip
HomeHub_Audit/
# Extracted design-handoff bundles (the .zips are ignored below; keep their unpacked folders out too).
HomeHub_*/
# Bundles pulled straight out of the Claude Design project (`.design-sync/NOTES.md` — pulling).
# They arrive under their own name now rather than as a HomeHub_* zip, so the pattern above never
# matched them: `design_handoff_bottom_nav/` was the first one landed on disk and would have been
# committed. They are inputs, re-pullable at any time, and the stale copy is the dangerous one.
design_handoff_*/
export_*/
handoff_*/
homehub-rework/
*.zip
# Extracted doc bundle — the authoritative copies of these live at the repo root.
homehub-docs/

